# The licensed font's DESKTOP file. This repo is public and PP Formula is a
# paid Pangram Pangram licence — the webfont (woff2) is what the site serves
# and is fine to ship, but the .otf is the desktop install and is not ours to
# redistribute. Kept local. Every browser since 2016 supports woff2, so the
# site does not need it.
assets/fonts/*.otf
